00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,733
舒服的桌子
shū fu de zhuō zi
Comfortable table

134
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:52,900
如果我看到一个东西我觉得有用
rú guǒ wǒ kàn dào yí ge dōng xi wǒ jué de yǒu yòng
If I see something that I find useful

135
00:07:53,733 --> 00:07:54,900
我会买
wǒ huì mǎi
I will buy

136
00:07:55,633 --> 00:07:59,800
如果我看到衣服我喜欢
rú guǒ wǒ kàn dào yī fu wǒ xǐ huān
If I see clothes I like

137
00:07:59,900 --> 00:08:01,600
我也会买
wǒ yě huì mǎi
I will buy it too

138
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,800
我不会想
wǒ bú huì xiǎng
I won't think

139
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,666
你不能买
nǐ bù néng mǎi
You can't buy

140
00:08:05,666 --> 00:08:08,066
你要有很少东西
nǐ yào yǒu hěn shǎo dōng xi
You need very few things

141
00:08:09,066 --> 00:08:10,233
没关系
méi guān xi
It doesn't matter

142
00:08:10,866 --> 00:08:14,933
所以这个就是我的想法
suǒ yǐ zhè ge jiù shì wǒ de xiǎng fǎ
So this is my idea

143
00:08:15,533 --> 00:08:21,500
你呢你有很多东西还是很少东西
nǐ ne nǐ yǒu hěn duō dōng xi hái shì hěn shǎo dōng xi
What about you? Do you have a lot of things or very few things?

144
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:26,933
你喜欢旅行的时候带很多东西
nǐ xǐ huān lǚ xíng de shí hou dài hěn duō dōng xi
Do you like to bring a lot of things with you when you travel?

145
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,200
带一个大箱子
dài yí ge dà xiāng zi
Bring a big box

146
00:08:29,266 --> 00:08:32,266
还是和智菲一样
hái shì hé zhì fēi yí yàng
Same as Zhifei

147
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:33,733
一个背包
yí ge bèi bāo
A backpack

148
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,500
一个小箱子
yí ge xiǎo xiāng zi
A small box

149
00:08:36,033 --> 00:08:39,200
还有如果你是女孩子
hái yǒu rú guǒ nǐ shì nǚ hái zi
And if you are a girl

150
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:42,266
你有没有很多衣服
nǐ yǒu méi yǒu hěn duō yī fu
Do you have a lot of clothes?

151
00:08:42,266 --> 00:08:46,400
你有没有觉得自己很漂亮
nǐ yǒu méi yǒu jué de zì jǐ hěn piào liang
Do you feel you are beautiful?

152
00:08:46,466 --> 00:08:49,033
穿很多漂亮的衣服
chuān hěn duō piào liang de yī fu
Wear lots of beautiful clothes

153
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:51,266
要告诉我
yào gào su wǒ
To tell me

154
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,466
请你给我留言
qǐng nǐ gěi wǒ liú yán
Please leave me a message

155
00:08:53,533 --> 00:08:55,633
下次见拜拜
xià cì jiàn bài bài
See you next time. Bye

